libeCRT -- An Embedded Small, Self Contained, Non Standard C Runtime library.

This is a collection of libraries, mostly taken from NetBSD, aimed at
providing a simple embedded libc to a program. This library has been
integrated into the A•NUX Project.

eCRT uses NTRTL (ananke/libs/ntrtl) for optimized string and memory
operations by default, providing better performance through
architecture-specific assembly implementations.

Compiler intrinsics have been moved to cCRT (ananke/libs/ccrt), which
provides multi-compiler support for GCC, Clang, MSVC, and Open Watcom.

